<title>FRANCE: Klima says ECB political counterweight important.</title>
<headline>Klima says ECB political counterweight important.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austrian Chancellor Viktor Klima said after talks with French Finance Minister Jean Arthuis here on Friday that a political counterweight to the future European central bank was important.</p>
<p>&quot;It is very important that in addition to an independent European central bank there be a council of stability, a forum that can assure the coordination of economic, financial and monetary policy that we need in Europe,&quot; he told reporters after the meeting.</p>
<p>Klima reiterated Austria's commitment to joining the first wave of countries launching the single euro currency and said Austria would meet the necessary criteria.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
